  "story": {
    "day": 48,
    "title": "A Special New Year's Day",
    "sentences": [
      "It was New Year's Day, and Kaya visited the old park.",
      "She went with her young sister to their old elementary school.",
      "Their grandfather, aunt, and dad were also here to do some work.",
      "First, they ate sweet fruit and a hot radish dish together.",
      "Then, some high school students played soccer and basketball.",
      "A boy with gray hair played the piano near the school.",
      "Another student played the trumpet and the drum.",
      "Kaya enjoyed the great music and she felt very happy.",
      "But the sky became dark, so her dad opened an umbrella.",
      "Kaya was hungry, so she ate every sweet cake.",
      "Finally, she smiled and said, \"Hey, it was a great day!\""
    ]
  }
}